# throwaway dogfood/diagnostic scripts
scripts/_*
# ...except the proof scripts tests/proofs.test.ts runs as CI-promoted checks. They were ignored
# with the rest, so a fresh clone failed 10 tests (found 2026-10-14 checking a clean worktree).
!scripts/_import-stage-retract.ts
